Developer Guide
===============

To refresh the dependencies in Eclipse, run:

  play "eclipse with-source=true"


js libs
-------

bootstrap-2.2.x.js: concatenate modal + tabs + typeahead


Functional Tests
----------------

To run the functional test only, run:
  
  play "test-only com.zenobase.testing.BrowserTest"

To run all tests except the functional test:

  play -Dwebdriver.enabled=false test
